## Key Takeaways

| Concept | Usage |
|---------|-------|
| Tools (ReAct reasoning) | `by llm(tools=[func1, func2])` |
| Object methods as tools | `by llm(tools=[self.method])` |
| Context injection | `by llm(incl_info={"key": value})` |
| `sem` on tools | Help LLM understand when to use tools |

