**SSO Endpoints:**

| Endpoint | Description |
|----------|-------------|
| `/sso/{platform}/login` | Initiate SSO login |
| `/sso/{platform}/register` | Initiate SSO registration |
| `/sso/{platform}/login/callback` | OAuth callback |

