## Introduction

### 1 What is Jac?

Jac is an AI-native full-stack programming language with Python-like syntax that compiles to Python bytecode, JavaScript, and native machine code (C-ABI compatible). It introduces Object-Spatial Programming (OSP) and novel constructs for AI-integrated programming (such as `by llm

={consoleOpen}
                        onToggle={onToggleConsole}
                        height={consoleHeight}
                        onHeightChange={onConsoleHeightChange}
                        output={output}
                        errors={errors}
                        logs={logs}
                        onClearOutput={onClearOutput}
                        onClearErrors={onClearErrors}
                        onClearLogs={onClearLogs}
                    />
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    );
}

